397
01:53:29,820 --> 01:53:41,440
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: I move that we recognize the Honorable Vice Chairperson, the Honorable John Tracy Cagas, of the Lone District of Davao del Sur, to sponsor the proposed budget of the Commission on Audit.

398
01:53:41,940 --> 01:53:50,880
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The Honorable Vice Chairperson, John Tracy Cagas, of the Lone District of Davao del Sur, is hereby recognized to sponsor the proposed budget of the Commission on Audit.

399
01:53:51,500 --> 01:53:53,480
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

400
01:53:55,260 --> 01:53:59,440
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: I would like also to include or acknowledge the respective

401
01:53:59,820 --> 01:54:07,480
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Regional Directors of COA, from the different regions of our beloved country.

402
01:54:09,740 --> 01:54:17,520
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleagues, magandang hapon po sa ating lahat.

403
01:54:17,520 --> 01:54:26,520
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: It is my honor to sponsor the budget of the Commission on Audit for Fiscal Year 2027,

404
01:54:28,140 --> 01:54:29,520
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: amounting to

405
01:54:29,820 --> 01:54:37,040
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: 16.46 billion pesos, inclusive of the automatic appropriations.

406
01:54:38,040 --> 01:54:45,020
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: In terms of new appropriations, which is subject for Congressional approval,

407
01:54:46,540 --> 01:54:52,460
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: the total budget of COA amounts to 14.774 billion,

408
01:54:52,460 --> 01:54:58,460
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: which represents an increase of about 2.49%.

409
01:54:59,820 --> 01:55:12,000
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: or 359.12 million, higher than the Fiscal Year 2026 level of 14.415 billion.

410
01:55:13,220 --> 01:55:22,720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Madam Speaker, this budget will be used to support the Commission's program, activities, and operations,

411
01:55:22,720 --> 01:55:26,720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: to ensure accountability for public resources,

412
01:55:28,260 --> 01:55:29,660
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: promote transparency,

413
01:55:29,840 --> 01:55:32,760
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: and help improve government operations

414
01:55:33,540 --> 01:55:39,400
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: in partnership with stakeholders for the benefit of the Filipino people.

415
01:55:40,480 --> 01:55:46,620
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: The Commission on Audit is the supreme auditing institution of our nation.

416
01:55:47,740 --> 01:55:51,900
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: It is the ultimate guardian for the public treasury

417
01:55:51,900 --> 01:55:56,200
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: and the bedrock of fiscal accountability.

418
01:55:56,240 --> 01:56:20,640
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: COA does not merely look at numbers. It ensures that every single peso contributed by our hardworking taxpayers is spent efficiently, effectively, and entirely for its intended public purpose.

419
01:56:20,640 --> 01:56:27,720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: The proposed budget is a vital investment in good governance.

420
01:56:27,720 --> 01:56:43,760
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: By equipping COA with necessary resources, we are strengthening its capability to conduct rigorous audits, expand its workforce of dedicated state auditors,

421
01:56:43,760 --> 01:56:50,260
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: and adopt digital innovations that bring greater transparency.

422
01:56:50,640 --> 01:57:03,080
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: To starve COA of resources is to weaken our defenses against waste and corruption.

423
01:57:04,420 --> 01:57:11,040
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: To support COA is to fortify the integrity of our entire bureaucracy.

424
01:57:11,420 --> 01:57:17,940
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: As we steer our nation toward broader economic growth and development,

425
01:57:18,680 --> 01:57:20,620
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: let us ensure that our

426
01:57:20,640 --> 01:57:28,180
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: oversight institutions remain strong, independent, and fully capable.

427
01:57:29,240 --> 01:57:30,780
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

428
01:57:31,820 --> 01:57:39,660
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: This presentation is now ready to answer questions from our distinguished colleagues.

429
01:57:40,960 --> 01:57:42,200
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

430
01:57:42,920 --> 01:57:49,280
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Iris Montes of the Partylist 4K

431
01:57:49,280 --> 01:57:50,380
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: to interpellate.

432
01:57:50,640 --> 01:57:52,860
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: On the proposed budget of the COA.

433
01:57:53,540 --> 01:57:57,580
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Honorable Iris Marie de Mesa Montes is hereby recognized for her interpellation.

434
01:57:58,360 --> 01:57:59,880
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

435
01:58:00,140 --> 01:58:02,260
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Magandang hapon po sa lahat.

436
01:58:02,380 --> 01:58:03,880
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ilang katanungan lamang po.

437
01:58:05,240 --> 01:58:09,240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Unang tanong ko po, sa laki ng mandato ng COA,

438
01:58:10,040 --> 01:58:20,620
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: sapat ba ang budget nito para maisa katuparan ang mas malawak at mas mabilis na auditing laban sa korupsyon?

439
01:58:20,640 --> 01:58:26,560
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: The question is, sapat na ba ang budget ng COA as proposed?

440
01:58:27,320 --> 01:58:32,880
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: The COA proposed originally before the NEP,

441
01:58:36,880 --> 01:58:41,580
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: 17 billion pesos.

442
01:58:41,580 --> 01:58:50,580
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Pero ang na-approve sa NEP ay 15 billion only.

443
01:58:50,640 --> 01:58:59,640
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yung dalawang bilyon na pesos ay para sana yun sa technological innovations.

444
01:59:00,140 --> 01:59:05,380
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Mga panibagong paggawa ng mga audit.

445
01:59:06,700 --> 01:59:16,660
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Unfortunately, we failed to provide what is necessary sa pamaraan ng pag-audit ngayon.

446
01:59:17,560 --> 01:59:18,740
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po.

447
01:59:18,740 --> 01:59:20,620
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yan po kasi yung sunod kong isa.

448
01:59:20,640 --> 01:59:25,500
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Itatanong, doon sa kakulangan sa budget na trinopose po ng COA,

449
01:59:25,840 --> 01:59:28,880
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ano po ang mga proyekto o programang matatamaan?

450
01:59:29,500 --> 01:59:32,240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: At ang susunod ko pong katanungan sana,

451
01:59:32,800 --> 01:59:38,760
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: magkano sana ang nakalaan sa proposed 2027 budget na dedicated to

452
01:59:38,760 --> 01:59:46,620
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: digital audit capabilities, data analytics, artificial intelligence, cyber security,

453
01:59:46,620 --> 01:59:50,600
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: and automated detection of anomalous transactions?

454
01:59:50,640 --> 01:59:59,500
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kasi po, sa panahon ngayon, alam din po yan ng COA kung gaano kahalaga ang teknolohiyang ito para mas mapabilis.

455
01:59:59,500 --> 02:00:00,000
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: at

456
02:00:00,000 --> 02:00:04,460
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: At mas accurate po yung ating mga audit reports.

457
02:00:11,240 --> 02:00:18,940
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: To be specific, distinguished interpellator, ito po yung nabawas, natanggal.

458
02:00:18,940 --> 02:00:36,060
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: M-O-O-E para sana sa mga P254 million and P420 pesos.

459
02:00:36,060 --> 02:00:51,300
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: At saka capital outlay na P1.177 million.

460
02:00:51,300 --> 02:00:52,100
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: 1 billion,

461
02:00:52,100 --> 02:00:54,580
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: 177 million.

462
02:00:55,560 --> 02:01:02,180
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So, ang budget ng kuha ngayon, walang capital outlay.

463
02:01:07,880 --> 02:01:11,040
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kung wala pong capital outlay, Mr. Speaker,

464
02:01:11,200 --> 02:01:15,420
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ibig sabihin, hindi nga po tayo pwedeng mag-procure

465
02:01:15,420 --> 02:01:17,920
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ng mga technological, ano,

466
02:01:18,940 --> 02:01:23,480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: equipment na makakatulong sana sa pag-audit ng kuha.

467
02:01:23,580 --> 02:01:24,300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, wala po.

468
02:01:24,680 --> 02:01:28,060
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ibig sabihin po ba sa 2027 proposed budget,

469
02:01:28,380 --> 02:01:31,440
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: kahit SINGCO, wala pong nakalaan para doon?

470
02:01:35,520 --> 02:01:42,520
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: To be a specific, Madam Interpellator, distinguished interpellator,

471
02:01:43,360 --> 02:01:48,440
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: semi-expendable information and communication technology, ICT,

472
02:01:48,940 --> 02:01:52,340
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: ITEMS and software subscription,

473
02:01:53,320 --> 02:01:55,900
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: fiscal year 2027,

474
02:01:56,500 --> 02:02:03,400
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Kuha Information System Strategic Plan or ISSP,

475
02:02:04,140 --> 02:02:10,300
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: na umabot po ng P213,686,000.

476
02:02:10,300 --> 02:02:17,600
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: At saka yung Citizen Participatory Audit or CPA,

477
02:02:18,940 --> 02:02:24,160
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: MOOE requirements, yung mga NGOs, POs na sasali sana sa auditing,

478
02:02:24,460 --> 02:02:35,720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: 40,734,000. Total po, 244?254 million 120,000.

479
02:02:35,720 --> 02:02:40,000
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Ito po sana yung gamitin para sa MOE, you know?

480
02:02:42,740 --> 02:02:47,360
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: At saka yung capital outlay naman, yung sa building ng kuha,

481
02:02:47,360 --> 02:02:54,320
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: building and structures, 484,617,000,

482
02:02:55,060 --> 02:03:01,820
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: yung mga furnitures and fixtures, 161,523,000,

483
02:03:02,540 --> 02:03:07,280
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: transportation equipment outlay, 5,600,000,

484
02:03:08,100 --> 02:03:15,460
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: ICT equipment and software, 525,405,000.

485
02:03:16,260 --> 02:03:17,300
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Total po.

486
02:03:17,360 --> 02:03:24,060
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Ang capital outlay is 1,177,145,000.

487
02:03:25,060 --> 02:03:28,760
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So hindi na po na-consider sa NEP.

488
02:03:29,500 --> 02:03:35,500
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So ibig sabihin nga po, wala tayong gagamitin na pag-procure nitong mga ito?

489
02:03:36,760 --> 02:03:37,780
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Wala po, madam.

490
02:03:37,900 --> 02:03:43,680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So ibig sabihin din po niyan, since wala tayong budget para dyan,

491
02:03:43,680 --> 02:03:47,080
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: maaantala po sana yung isang,

492
02:03:47,360 --> 02:03:53,260
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: teknolohiyang pwede nating magamit para mas mapalakas at mapabilis ang ating audit.

493
02:03:53,480 --> 02:03:54,160
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Tama po ba?

494
02:03:55,060 --> 02:04:04,420
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yes, maaantala po yung trabaho nila sa mga bagong panibagong paraan sana.

495
02:04:05,020 --> 02:04:09,280
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Pero despite of it, I commend COA, you know?

496
02:04:11,280 --> 02:04:17,320
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Kung natatandaan natin, even the meager resources we are giving them,

497
02:04:17,360 --> 02:04:20,960
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: kahit kunti, they try their best.

498
02:04:21,960 --> 02:04:23,460
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Talagang nagsusumikap sila.

499
02:04:24,500 --> 02:04:29,720
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yes, we acknowledge that, Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague.

500
02:04:30,260 --> 02:04:34,360
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pero syempre, gusto natin na bigyan din yung kahalagahan ng teknolohiya.

501
02:04:35,060 --> 02:04:41,000
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Sa panahon ngayon na iba na po ang nakasanayan ng mga tao,

502
02:04:41,000 --> 02:04:47,000
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: o madami na pong pagbabago, dapat po syempre yung ating audit systems can keep up.

503
02:04:47,360 --> 02:04:50,340
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: With the changes na nangyayari din, ano po?

504
02:04:50,860 --> 02:04:57,560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So yun lamang po ang gusto kong puntuhin na mahalaga na nababadgetan po natin yung teknolohiya

505
02:04:57,560 --> 02:04:59,080
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: para mas mapalakas po.

506
02:04:59,200 --> 02:05:06,580
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Mamaya po, babanggitin ko po uli kung bakit mahalaga din po yung mga teknolohiyang yan.

507
02:05:06,900 --> 02:05:09,360
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: On to my next question, Madam Speaker.

508
02:05:09,700 --> 02:05:13,520
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pagdating naman po sa coverage at sa capacity ng COA pa,

509
02:05:13,520 --> 02:05:16,340
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ilang porsyento ng mga ehensya at LG,

510
02:05:16,340 --> 02:05:19,200
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: yung aktwal na naa-audit ng COA kada taon.

511
02:05:19,940 --> 02:05:25,720
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Are we 100% naaabot po natin, isang daang porsyentong audit?

512
02:05:30,080 --> 02:05:36,620
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Except barangay, mga barangay local government units,

513
02:05:36,620 --> 02:05:45,520
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: lahat po ng munisipyo, probinsya, at national agencies ay na-audit po ng COA.

514
02:05:46,340 --> 02:05:49,240
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kung sakali po bang meron tayong technical capacity,

515
02:05:49,420 --> 02:05:52,020
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: maaabot po ba natin up to the barangay level?

516
02:05:52,240 --> 02:05:54,020
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: If our, you know, if our...

517
02:05:56,520 --> 02:05:59,680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ano po ba ang dahilan kung bakit hindi naaabot yun?

518
02:05:59,800 --> 02:06:02,740
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kulang sa oras? Kulang sa resources?

519
02:06:13,020 --> 02:06:15,360
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Ah, magandang tanong po yan.

520
02:06:15,780 --> 02:06:16,260
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Maganda.

521
02:06:17,000 --> 02:06:19,660
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: English Interpolator.

522
02:06:20,180 --> 02:06:23,700
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Kung merong sapat na teknolohiya.

523
02:06:24,880 --> 02:06:30,220
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Kasi ngayon, cyclical ay yung audit ng barangay every three years lang.

524
02:06:30,720 --> 02:06:33,600
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Sa dami, 42,000 barangays.

525
02:06:34,380 --> 02:06:37,240
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Pero kung may sapat na teknolohiya,

526
02:06:37,240 --> 02:06:44,100
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: pwede pong gawin yearly yung audit ng barangay.

527
02:06:44,680 --> 02:06:45,980
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po.

528
02:06:46,340 --> 02:07:03,880
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Madam Speaker, pagdating naman po sa competence and integrity ng personal, paano po tinitiyak ng COA na ang kanilang mga auditors ay may sapat na training, competence at integridad upang hindi maging bahagi po ng problema?

529
02:07:03,880 --> 02:07:28,760
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yung tungkol po sa training, competency and capability of state auditors, upon entry po, pagpasok ng empleyado sa COA, start the training right away.

530
02:07:28,760 --> 02:07:32,340
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: At saka tuloy-tuloy na yan, hanggang tataas-tataas yan.

531
02:07:32,340 --> 02:07:52,220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: We retain them in the agency. After training po ba, may porsyento po ba dyan na umaalis? O meron po silang, kumbaga may return service or kung meron hindi po return service, may pinirmahan na kontrata na magsiserve sila ng specific period?

532
02:08:02,340 --> 02:08:16,140
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yung mga specialized klase ng training, may kontrata po yun na they have to return the investment ng goberno.

533
02:08:17,040 --> 02:08:27,020
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Pero yung mga regular trainings, which is done regularly, wala naman pong kontrata yun. Yung mga specialized training lang po.

534
02:08:28,500 --> 02:08:32,220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Do we also have, kaugnay po niyan, may budget po ba?

535
02:08:32,340 --> 02:08:55,420
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Do we also have, na nakalaan sa pag-hire halimbawa ng mga engineers, yung mga IT specialists, yung mga specialized po na profession that can help COA detect mga highly technical din po na mga dapat na i-audit nila?

536
02:09:00,460 --> 02:09:02,320
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Gusto [unclear] ng COA

537
02:09:02,340 --> 02:09:17,340
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: na mag-hire ng mga specialized fields of knowledge. Limitado po yung item or plantilia ng COA. Meron silang engineer pero limited talaga.

538
02:09:18,060 --> 02:09:32,340
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yes po. Thank you Madam Chair, Madam Speaker. Ang punto ko po kasi, alam naman natin kung how the government processes have become increasingly complex.

539
02:09:32,340 --> 02:09:59,560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: complex sa panahon ngayon. And dagdag re-require din po ito na matugunan natin ng personnel who have the expertise. Halimbawa sa mga infrastructure projects, meron po ba tayo dyan sapat na mga ingeniero, arkitekto, siguro kasama pa yung mga financial analysts, tama po ba ang presyong ito?

540
02:09:59,560 --> 02:10:15,780
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kasi ako po naniniwala kung sapat po yung ating personnel, ang know-how ng ating personnel, ang kanilang experience, ang kanilang expertise, mabilis tayong gumawa, may teknolohiya tayo, mas mabilis po nating magagawa ang audit.

541
02:10:15,780 --> 02:10:28,900
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So ang tanong ko po sa COA, through the years, alam nyo po ito, ang sagot nyo po, wala kayong enough personnel, nag-request na po ba tayo sa DBM ng additional plantilia items?

542
02:10:28,900 --> 02:10:32,720
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Para matugunan natin ang gap na pong ito?

543
02:10:33,660 --> 02:10:41,140
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: The COA family fully agrees with you, Madam Interpellator.

544
02:10:44,580 --> 02:10:50,860
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Have you requested the DBM about the plantilia items that you need?

545
02:10:54,860 --> 02:10:58,860
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yes, the COA requested the DBM about the...

546
02:10:58,900 --> 02:11:02,040
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: plantilia items.

547
02:11:05,660 --> 02:11:08,960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, madam speaker.

548
02:11:09,460 --> 02:11:21,960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pagdating naman po sa effectiveness natin, ilang corruption-related audit findings nag-resulta po sa aktual na kaso o sanction noong 2025 na lamang po?

549
02:11:43,300 --> 02:11:45,800
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Thank you for asking that, madam tripulator.

550
02:11:47,740 --> 02:11:53,440
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Because that really ring a bell to our nation.

551
02:11:55,440 --> 02:12:03,100
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yung ginawa ng COA, arising from that scandal,

552
02:12:04,580 --> 02:12:07,540
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Nagpile ng COA ng fraud audit.

553
02:12:07,860 --> 02:12:09,240
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Nagawa ng fraud audit.

554
02:12:09,680 --> 02:12:19,300
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: At itong audit nila, yun ang ginawang basis or basihan para ma-file yun sa Ombudsman.

555
02:12:20,240 --> 02:12:24,840
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So, more or less, about...

556
02:12:28,900 --> 02:12:45,860
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Bulacan alone, the epicenter of the, Bulacan alone, mga 50 cases, criminal cases, ang na-submit sa Ombudsman.

557
02:12:48,040 --> 02:12:50,160
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

558
02:12:53,160 --> 02:12:58,320
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Paano po nasisiguran ng COA na ang mga audit reports na ginagawa nito?

559
02:12:58,900 --> 02:13:04,800
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ay ano po ang sukatan na ginagamit na talagang nakakapagbawas tayo ng corruption sa gobyerno?

560
02:13:05,140 --> 02:13:06,680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: May sukatan po ba ang COA?

