07:56:56,620 --> 07:56:58,660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: More than 10 times the target.

5943
07:56:58,660 --> 07:57:00,340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit po?

5944
07:57:00,500 --> 07:57:05,860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mag-target ng 548 pero ma-complace 5,500.

5945
07:57:23,860 --> 07:57:25,700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung ibang agency kasi,

5946
07:57:25,840 --> 07:57:27,940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hirap pa nga sila makuha yung target nila.

5947
07:57:28,640 --> 07:57:29,940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sana BIR kayo.

5948
07:57:30,500 --> 07:57:33,340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Target 500, makulikta 1,500.

5949
07:57:33,340 --> 07:57:35,260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ako, 5,500.

5950
