6558
08:30:37,840 --> 08:30:43,200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Babalikan po natin yan, Mr. Sponsor, yung katanungan dyan.

6559
08:30:44,220 --> 08:30:51,700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dito po sa National Action Plan on Women, Peace, and Security.

6560
08:30:52,420 --> 08:30:57,660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Noong 2025, ang target po ng OPAPRO ay,

6561
